  "_what": "Paired bootstrap contrasts between all three arms of the shipped-recipe detector ablation, on all 97 GIFT-Eval configurations. Positive = the first arm named in the key is worse.",
  "_convention": "8-checkpoint soup. Each arm is the uniform average of its 8 periodic saves at steps 29000-36000 (runs_soup.log.gz names them), which EXCLUDES last.ckpt at step 36621. The published seed-42 soup was built from exactly those eight as well: it reconstructs from them element-for-element across all 321225 weights (provenance/verify_soup_inputs.py), differing only in summing them in descending rather than ascending step order, which moves 4 weights by one bf16 ulp and is worth 5.1e-05 nGMASE when scored. Its level is therefore directly comparable to these three. This file holds three arms because it predates that check; four_arm_soup_bootstrap.json adds seed 42 and changes no contrast here.",
